  (
    'novo-nordisk-vs-eli-lilly-why-the-consensus-has-it-backwards-again',
    'Novo Nordisk vs Eli Lilly: why the consensus has it backwards — again',
    'Last week’s headlines were almost gleeful: Eli Lilly’s new oral weight-loss pill, orforglipron, hits Phase 3 target. Novo Nordisk’s share price promptly fell 7 per cent, as if the Danish titan had finally been out-flanked. Hold on. A quick read of the clinical timelines tells a very different…',
    '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Last week’s headlines were almost gleeful: "},{"type":"text","text":"Eli Lilly’s new oral weight-loss pill, orforglipron, hits Phase 3 target","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Novo Nordisk’s share price promptly fell 7 per cent, as if the Danish titan had finally been out-flanked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hold on.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A quick read of the clinical timelines tells a very different story. Novo Nordisk is already "},{"type":"text","text":"a full year ahead","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in the race for an effective, convenient weight-loss tablet — and its candidate, oral semaglutide, is posting stronger numbers."}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The state of play in tablets:"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/novo-nordisk-vs-eli-lilly-why-the-consensus-has-it-backwards-again/1.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Novo Nordisk – oral semaglutide 25 mg","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eli Lilly – orforglipron 36 mg","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Average weight loss"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"12.9 – 16.6 %","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Phase 3 OASIS-4)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"7.9 %","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (latest Phase 3)"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cardiovascular benefit"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 14 % cut in major events (SOUL trial)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"None yet shown"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Regulatory timetable"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Filing to the US FDA "},{"type":"text","text":"Q1 2025","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Filing "},{"type":"text","text":"late 2025 / early 2026","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Media buzz"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quiet"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Loud"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The real surprise? Novo has been refining oral semaglutide since 2019, when the low-dose version (7 mg / 14 mg) won approval as the diabetes drug "},{"type":"text","text":"Rybelsus","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Higher doses are now locked in for weight management:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"15 % loss","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" at 50 mg (OASIS-1, 2023)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"13 – 17 % loss","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" at 25 mg with milder nausea (OASIS-4, 2024)"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/novo-nordisk-vs-eli-lilly-why-the-consensus-has-it-backwards-again/2.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cardiovascular protection is the kicker. The SOUL study showed a "},{"type":"text","text":"14 %","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" reduction in heart attacks and strokes — a data point Lilly doesn’t yet have."}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rapidly expanding pie, not a shrinking slice"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since 2023 the obesity-drug market has ballooned "},{"type":"text","text":"131 % year-on-year","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Novo’s share has slipped from a monopoly to roughly two-thirds, thanks to Lilly’s injectable "},{"type":"text","text":"Zepbound","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":", yet Novo still grew its own sales "},{"type":"text","text":"66 %","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" over the same period. With an estimated "},{"type":"text","text":"800 million","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" people worldwide living with obesity or diabetes, this market is nowhere near saturation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Novo isn’t diversifying away; it’s doubling down:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Massive US capacity build-out","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to end supply bottlenecks."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Targeted acquisitions","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that add manufacturing scale, not new therapeutic gambles."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A deep pipeline — including "},{"type":"text","text":"Amycretin","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (oral, Phase 2) and "},{"type":"text","text":"CagriSema","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (injectable combo) — ready to slot in as semaglutide eventually goes generic."}]}]}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What about the “other” competitors?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Amgen, Roche, Viking Therapeutics and Structure Therapeutics each have candidates in early-stage trials, but none will reach the market before the early 2030s. For the foreseeable future, "},{"type":"text","text":"Novo Nordisk and Eli Lilly remain a comfortable duopoly","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Valuation checkpoint"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/novo-nordisk-vs-eli-lilly-why-the-consensus-has-it-backwards-again/3.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Back in March or February I called Novo “quality at a fair price” on 29× earnings and picked up a starter parcel. After the sell-off the shares trade on:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"17× trailing","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" earnings"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"≈14× forward","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" earnings (2025 consensus)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Management is guiding to "},{"type":"text","text":"16 – 24 % revenue and profit growth","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for 2025, putting the PEG comfortably below 1. Return on invested capital sits north of 60 %. In short, the market has served up an Easter bargain."}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom line"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The noise around Lilly’s Phase 3 read-out has overshadowed the facts:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Novo’s oral semaglutide is ahead in the queue","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"text","text":"more efficacious","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It already carries a "},{"type":"text","text":"cardiovascular benefit label","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The overall market is exploding; losing a few points of share still means outsized growth."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sometimes the hardest part of investing is ignoring the headlines and reading the data. I’ll happily add to my position while the crowd fixates on the wrong horse."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Written by Eeshan Karra","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Disclaimer","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":": This article is for information and education only and is "},{"type":"text","text":"not","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" financial advice. Do your own research or consult a licensed adviser before making investment decisions."}]}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"}]}'::jsonb,
    '/imported/novo-nordisk-vs-eli-lilly-why-the-consensus-has-it-backwards-again/1.webp',
    'Novo Nordisk vs Eli Lilly: why the consensus has it backwards — again',
    array['Healthcare']::text[],
    'Last week’s headlines were almost gleeful: Eli Lilly’s new oral weight-loss pill, orforglipron, hits Phase 3 target. Novo Nordisk’s share price promptly fell 7…',
    'published',
    '2025-04-29T05:45:40.000Z'::timestamptz,
    3
