    'is-big-tech-really-this-dumb-how-100-chinese-engineers-built-an-ai-for-6m-that',
    'Is Big Tech Really This Dumb? How 100 Chinese Engineers Built an AI for $6M That Shakes the Industry',
    'It’s the billion-dollar question on everyone’s mind: Did US tech giants really spend hundreds of billions over several years just to build something that a small team of 100 Chinese engineers managed to create for a mere $6 million? The shockwaves from this revelation are hitting hard, and the…',
    '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It’s the billion-dollar question on everyone’s mind:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Did US tech giants really spend "},{"type":"text","text":"hundreds of billions","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" over several years just to build something that a small team of 100 Chinese engineers managed to create for a mere "},{"type":"text","text":"$6 million","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"?"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/is-big-tech-really-this-dumb-how-100-chinese-engineers-built-an-ai-for-6m-that/1.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The shockwaves from this revelation are hitting hard, and the implications could be massive."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why the fear"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"At first glance, you might think:"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"“Okay, but how does this affect end users? Companies are still going to need AI services, right?”","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not necessarily."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DeepSeek isn’t necessarily "},{"type":"text","text":"better","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" than OpenAI’s models, but it’s "},{"type":"text","text":"just as good","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for most tasks—and "},{"type":"text","text":"far more accessible","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/is-big-tech-really-this-dumb-how-100-chinese-engineers-built-an-ai-for-6m-that/2.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here’s the game-changer:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It enables AI innovation everywhere.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Developers worldwide can collaborate, refine it, and improve it continuously—just like open-source software has done for decades."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Deepseek is free.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Anyone can take it, modify it, and run it independently—without paying OpenAI, Google, or any other AI giant."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It gives total control to users.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" No reliance on centralized AI providers, no forced subscriptions, no restrictions on how you can use it."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Stockfish Moment for AI"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is "},{"type":"text","text":"Stockfish for AI","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/is-big-tech-really-this-dumb-how-100-chinese-engineers-built-an-ai-for-6m-that/3.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you’re into chess, you know what happened when Stockfish became the dominant engine: No matter how much Google’s AlphaZero tried to outpace it, the open-source community "},{"type":"text","text":"always caught up","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". And ultimately, Stockfish remained the go-to choice because it was free, continuously improving, and available to all."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DeepSeek does the same for AI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now, startups in "},{"type":"text","text":"every country","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" can "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" start from the current state-of-the-art instead of lagging years behind industry leaders."}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Europe?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" No more reliance on the US or pressure to comply with Big Tech’s rules. They can launch their own AI models while following EU regulations."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Developing countries?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" No need for billion-dollar investments. They can build AI solutions at scale without buying proprietary models."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Businesses?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" They no longer have to pay OpenAI or Google for AI services they can run in-house at a fraction of the cost."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A Future Beyond Big Tech"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bigger picture is clear:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If a group of engineers can replicate years of Big Tech’s AI development "},{"type":"text","text":"for just $6 million","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":", what’s stopping others from doing the same?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The myth that only trillion-dollar companies can build world-class AI is crumbling."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"And if AI is truly democratised through open-source models like DeepSeek, the entire "},{"type":"text","text":"business model of AI as a walled garden controlled by a handful of corporations","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" could collapse."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Big Tech isn’t dumb—but they may have just lost their greatest competitive edge."}]}]}'::jsonb,
