  (
    'journey-and-motivation',
    'Journey and Motivation',
    'In the ever-evolving world, the art of forging genuine connections remains timeless. Whether it’s with colleagues, clients, or partners, establishing a genuine rapport paves the way for collaborative success.',
    '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When I first started thinking seriously about my finances, it felt overwhelming. The world of personal finance seemed full of jargon, charts, and complicated concepts. Here’s to the start of a journey in which I attempt to decode the vast ocean of finance."}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"“An investment in knowledge pays the best interest.”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"– Benjamin Franklin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Below are a list of things that we will explore:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bookkeeping & tracking finances"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"US market"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Financial discipline"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Investing"}]}]}]}]}'::jsonb,
