  (
    'how-to-build-a-strong-financial-foundation',
    'How to Build a Strong Financial Foundation',
    'Challenges in business are a given, but it’s our response to them that defines our trajectory. Looking beyond the immediate obstacle, there lies a realm of opportunity and learning.',
    '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/how-to-build-a-strong-financial-foundation/1.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many people including myself want to get into investing, or managing their finances. How to read balance sheets, or understand the numbers that track their expenditures. Yet most of us don’t and probably never will learn these basics. Basics that prevent most of the population from building their wealth."}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"“Financial freedom is available to those who learn about it and work for it.”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"– Robert Kiyosaki"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can’t start tracking and managing your finances without understanding financial accounting. Trust me I have tried."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"▶ Watch the video on YouTube","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v-djL7SPw4c"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Above is a guide to all you will need. A comprehensive workshop on the key knowledge of the accounting world. Right now, learning is the most important part. Learning how to analyse a company’s fundamentals, how to track your expenses, how to manage assets."}]}]}'::jsonb,
    '/imported/how-to-build-a-strong-financial-foundation/2.webp',
    'How to Build a Strong Financial Foundation',
    array['Personal Finance', 'Beginners']::text[],
    'Challenges in business are a given, but it’s our response to them that defines our trajectory. Looking beyond the immediate obstacle, there lies a realm of…',
    'published',
    '2024-12-17T09:17:30.000Z'::timestamptz,
