  (
    'assets-vs-liabilities',
    'Assets vs. Liabilities',
    'Every business has a unique potential waiting to be tapped. Recognizing the keys to unlock this growth can set an enterprise on the path to unprecedented success.',
    '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"/imported/assets-vs-liabilities/1.webp","alt":"","caption":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When I first heard the terms “assets” and “liabilities,” they sounded like complicated accounting jargon. But understanding these concepts is crucial for building wealth."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What Are Assets and Liabilities?"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Assets","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Things that put money in your pocket. Examples include stocks, rental properties, and even a profitable side hustle."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Liabilities","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Things that take money out of your pocket. Examples include credit card debt, car loans, and anything that depreciates in value over time."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why This Distinction Matters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Focusing on acquiring assets while minimising liabilities is the key to growing your net worth. For example, buying a rental property can generate passive income, while purchasing a luxury car often results in ongoing expenses."}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"“Do not save what is left after spending, but spend what is left after saving.”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"– Warren Buffett"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"My Journey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When I started tracking my finances, I realised I had more liabilities than assets. Slowly but surely, I’m building a portfolio of assets that work for me."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The takeaway? Prioritise assets and be mindful of how liabilities can hold you back. Small shifts in focus can have a big impact over time."}]}]}'::jsonb,
    '/imported/assets-vs-liabilities/2.webp',
    'Assets vs. Liabilities',
